  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Resilience in the Kaya-Dori Axis in Burkina Faso</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve the living conditions and livelihoods of vulnerable communities in the Kaya-Dori axis in Burkina Faso through a systemic and inclusive approach to water, sanitaion and hygiene and rehabilitation of local productive assets via innovative and resilient agriculture</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The restoration of security and peace, strengthening resilience, and local economy relying on strong, green, sustainable, and inclusive growth&#x25a3; &#xc2e4;&#xd5a5;&#xbbfc; &#xc99d;&#xac00;&#xc5d0; &#xb530;&#xb978; &#xc778;&#xb3c4;&#xc8fc;&#xc758; &#xbe44;&#xc0c1;&#xc0ac;&#xd0dc; &#xad00;&#xb9ac; &#xb2a5;&#xb825; &#xac15;&#xd654;</narrative>
